  "notes": "Multirate module: 64GFC (57.8 Gb/s PAM4, RS(544,514) FEC, BER 1.09E-4), 32GFC (28.05 Gb/s NRZ, RS(528,514) FEC, BER 1E-6), 16GFC (14.025 Gb/s NRZ, no FEC, BER 1E-12). TX/RX optical and sensitivity limits differ by mode; 10 km reach on single-mode fiber per title and SFP ID. Power consumption 2.0 W max at 3.3 V ±5%; 2.1 W max at 3.3 V +0/–5% over 70°C. Transmitter Distortion Penalty (TDP) max 2.7 dB at 32GFC and 4.4 dB at 16GFC stated but not in penalty-point format.",
